  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the ttukbaegi earthenware cookware to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a small bowl, mix together allspice, brown sugar, and soy sauce.",
    "Add the pork pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Grill the bacon slices until crispy, then set aside.",
    "Add the pork to the preheated earthenware cookware and cook for 3 minutes per side.",
    "Add the pineapple rings to the earthenware cookware and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until slightly caramelized.",
    "Brush the pork and pineapple with the remaining spice mixture.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Assemble the sliders by placing a piece of pork and a pineapple ring onto a toasted bun, topped with crispy bacon and a sprinkle of black pepper.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
